        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section: Day 4 Results — Evening -->
      <section class="content-card">
        <h2>Day 4 Results — Tuesday 17 November 2026 (Evening Session)</h2>
        <p>
          All 8 deciding group matches (Groups I–P) are complete, and the group stage is over. Luke Humphries beat Joe Cullen 5–2 to top Group I — Cullen averaged 103 and still lost. Tom Sykes beat Krzysztof Ratajski 5–1 with a 104 average to top Group J. James Wade whitewashed Ricky Evans 5–0 with a 103 average to top Group K. Michael van Gerwen survived a deciding leg against Jeffrey de Graaf, 5–4, despite missing ten match darts, to top Group L. Gian van Veen beat Bradley Brooks 5–2 to top Group M. Martin Schindler beat Chris Dobey 5–3 to top Group N. Gabriel Clemens beat Rusty-Jake Rodriguez 5–3 to top Group O — Rodriguez missed double 19 for the four legs he needed to progress. Nathan Aspinall whitewashed Karel Sedlacek 5–0 to top Group P, dropping only one leg in the whole group stage. The eight group winners — Humphries, Sykes, Wade, van Gerwen, van Veen, Schindler, Clemens and Aspinall — reach the Last 16 on Thursday 19 November: Humphries v Sykes, Wade v van Gerwen, van Veen v Schindler and Clemens v Aspinall.
        </p>
        <p><strong>Evening session — Tuesday 17 November:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Luke Humphries 5–2 Joe Cullen (I)</li>
          <li>Krzysztof Ratajski 1–5 Tom Sykes (J)</li>
          <li>James Wade 5–0 Ricky Evans (K)</li>
