        <p>
          Both semi-finals are complete (best of 31 legs), and the final is set. Gerwyn Price beat Kevin Doets 16–13 — Price led 10–4 after six legs in a row, Doets fought back to 14–12, but Price sealed it with a 12-darter in the closing leg. Gian van Veen beat Michael van Gerwen 16–11 in the all-Dutch semi-final, pulling away from 5–5 with a 124 checkout on the bullseye and a 107 finish on double 16 to reach his first Grand Slam final. The final is tonight: <strong>Gerwyn Price v Gian van Veen, 19:30 GMT (00:30 PKT on Monday 23 November)</strong> — read our <a href="/tournament/grand-slam-final-preview/">Grand Slam final preview</a>.
        </p>
        <p><strong>Afternoon session — Sunday 22 November:</strong></p>
