        <h2>How to Watch Live on Television &amp; Online</h2>
        <p>
          Live coverage of the 2026 Grand Slam of Darts is televised domestically in the United Kingdom on <strong>Sky Sports</strong> and streamed contract-free on <strong>NOW</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          International supporters outside the UK can stream every session live via the official <strong>PDCTV</strong> platform, with regional linear coverage carried by <strong>DAZN</strong> across Germany, Austria, and Switzerland, and <strong>Viaplay</strong> in the Netherlands and Nordics.
        </p>
        <p>
